        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSW325, Solid Brass Wall Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty wall mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. Packaged complete with all installation hardware. It is available in great finishes. A large, heavy duty door stop it is great for both residential and commercial doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSW325U-specifications.gif?v=1704354636\" width=\"410\" height=\"167\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Heavy Duty Wall Mount Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-wall-mount-bumper-with-hook-deltana-sahw325\">Large Wall Mounted Door Stop with Hook</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana DSW325 Wall Mount Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-heavy-duty-door-stops-deltana-dsf-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 1\" Diameter, Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSW325.pdf?v=1704262155\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSW325 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
