                "description": "Solid Brass Wall Mount Door Stop Deltana DSW325 - This heavy duty wall mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. Packaged complete with all installation hardware. It is available in 9 great finishes. A large, heavy duty door stop it is great for both residential and commercial doors. \r\n",
